@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] runtime-secret-custody
Host SSH and derived age private identities MUST stay with the root preparation
process. Only selected application secrets may enter published bundles. Private
identities, decrypted values and raw resolver errors MUST NOT enter diagnostics,
process arguments, the Nix store or reusable images.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:recovery] secret-bundle-publication
A bundle MUST be validated in full before atomic directory publication. Missing,
undecryptable or malformed secrets MUST fail preparation without publishing a
partial new bundle. Publication MUST reject untrusted or symlinked paths.
